---
import ResearchLayout from "../../layouts/ResearchLayout.astro";
---

<ResearchLayout
  title="從一場技術論壇開始"
  page="P1"
  signal="Story"
  evidence="Event"
  focus="Event → Research Start"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-inner">
      <div class="kicker">RESEARCH · VOL.01 · P1</div>
      <h1>從一場技術論壇開始</h1>
      <p>2026.06.25 · TSMC China Technology Symposium</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">RESEARCH START</div>
        <h2>研究不是從哪一檔股票會漲開始</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <article class="card">
      <p>研究不是從「哪一檔股票會漲」開始，而是從一個產業事件開始，重新建立技術路徑。</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="feature">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <div class="kicker">EVENT</div>
          <h2>TSMC China Technology Symposium</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <article class="card">
        <p>台積電於 2026 年 6 月 25 日在上海舉辦 China Technology Symposium。官方議程涵蓋 HPC、先進邏輯製程、3DFabric、先進封裝、製造與 Open Innovation Platform。</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">WHY THIS EVENT MATTERS</div>
        <h2>從 transistor scaling 延伸至 system integration</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <article class="card">
      <p>值得研究之處，不只是單一製程節點，而是技術從 transistor scaling 一路延伸至 system integration 的完整路徑。</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</ResearchLayout>
